69
00:15:17,091 --> 00:15:20,432
3. satırı eksi 1 bölü 9 ile çarpacağım.

70
00:15:20,432 --> 00:15:22,111
Neyi elde edeceğim?

71
00:15:22,111 --> 00:15:22,611
Şu.

72
00:15:22,611 --> 00:15:29,711
1, eksi 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1.

73
00:15:29,711 --> 00:15:42,251
1.

74
00:15:42,251 --> 00:15:43,251
0.

75
00:15:43,251 --> 00:15:50,251
1.

76
00:15:40,115 --> 00:15:40,556
